{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C3\", \"C1\", \"C2\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\"],\n  \"why\": \"keep：C1最完整地保留了不再反复检查对方心意、不逼自己毫无期待、真心关心对方并享受独自喜欢的甜意这几层意思，尤其保留了真心盼对方过得好的态度；C2稍弱，C3则省略了不再检查和不再强迫自己的关键选择。cover：C2最能解释甜意中为何会浮现酸楚，亲近无法代替他承受内心的期待，直接接上B3的独处感，也保留了B2所说念头暂时平息又重新出现的过程；C1也能解释孤单，但原因稍显宽泛；C3的害怕失去更接近对关系未来的担忧，不完全是珠子所说的独处感。lean：C3把末尾的酸楚收束为对眼前亲近留不住的担心，心理步骤最少；C1增加了对方未必理解自己的认识，但仍有清楚的因果；C2末句再次强调想被珍惜，与前文重复较多。plain：C1用对方未必懂、心里有点孤单来交代自己的处境，具体而自然；C3也比较像人在说自己的事，但留不住的表达稍显概括；C2的亲近再深也不能替他感受带有较明显的总结意味。总体C1在内容完整、表达自然和解释力之间最均衡；C2对B3的解释更好，但重复和抽象感稍重；C3虽然简洁，却把这一段的重心从重新安顿喜欢转向了害怕失去亲近。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fc967a3d-ea66-4b93-8e8e-52fa6fe2e82c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T230108185455Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.484, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:02:16.671098+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bb660e1ad9831362d3c0bc6873975f985bbcbccda585efacb5de8998967c9586", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment